{"title":"Mississippi mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Mississippi_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mississippi middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Mississippi_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mississippi high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mississippi_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Mississippi middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Mississippi middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_MathCounts\" title=\"Mississippi MathCounts\">Mississippi MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ala-La-Miss_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_Council_of_Teachers_of_Mathematics_State_Mathematics_Competition_for_Junior_High_Students&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mississippi Council of Teachers of Mathematics State Mathematics Competition for Junior High Students (page does not exist)\">Mississippi Council of Teachers of Mathematics State Mathematics Competition for Junior High Students</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ole_Miss_Problem_of_the_Week&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ole Miss Problem of the Week (page does not exist)\">Ole Miss Problem of the Week</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.olemiss.edu/mathed/contest/contests.htm\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mississippi_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Mississippi high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Mississippi high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ala-La-Miss_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_College_Math_%26_Science_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mississippi College Math &amp; Science Tournament (page does not exist)\">Mississippi College Math &amp; Science Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mc.edu/newsevents/prnews/user/story.php?id=105\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ole_Miss_Problem_of_the_Week&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ole Miss Problem of the Week (page does not exist)\">Ole Miss Problem of the Week</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.olemiss.edu/mathed/contest/contests.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Mississippi_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Mississippi High School Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">University of Mississippi High School Mathematics Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.olemiss.edu/depts/mathematics/mathcontest/index.html\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississippi_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018095714\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-